---
title: ProximaDB - PAX Block Format Class Diagram (Custom Columnar Storage)
---
classDiagram
    class PaxBlock {
        +MagicBytes: [u8; 4] = b"PAX!"
        +Version: u16
        +Flags: u16
        +NumRows: u32
        +NumColumns: u16
        +CompressionScheme: CompressionCodec
        +ColumnOffsets: Vec~u64~
        +FooterOffset: u64
        +Checksum: u64
        +TotalSize: u64
        +validate() Result
        +read_footer() PaxFooter
        +project_columns(cols) Result
    }

    class PaxFooter {
        +ZoneMaps: Vec~ZoneMap~
        +BloomFilters: Vec~BloomFilter~
        +Statistics: BlockStatistics
        +EncodingMetadata: Vec~ColumnEncoding~
        +MinTimestamp: DateTime
        +MaxTimestamp: DateTime
        +RecordCount: u32
        +TotalUncompressedSize: u64
        +TotalCompressedSize: u64
    }

    class PaxColumnChunk {
        +ColumnIndex: u16
        +DataType: ColumnType
        +Encoding: ColumnEncoding
        +Compression: CompressionCodec
        +Offset: u64
        +CompressedSize: u64
        +UncompressedSize: u64
        +NullCount: u32
        +HasDictionary: bool
        +raw_bytes() Vec~u8~
        +decompress() Vec~u8~
        +decode() ColumnArray
    }

    class ZoneMap {
        +ColumnIndex: u16
        +MinValue: ScalarValue
        +MaxValue: ScalarValue
        +NullCount: u32
        +HasNulls: bool
        +prune(predicate) bool
    }

    class PaxSegmentScanner {
        +BlockIndex: BlockMetadataIndex
        +ObjectStore: Arc~ProximaObjectStore~
        +Path: DrPath
        +read_records(predicate) Stream
        +project_columns(cols) Stream
        +prune_with_zonemaps() Vec~BlockRange~
        +apply_bloom_filter(needle) bool
    }

    class PaxBlockWriter {
        +Buffer: Vec~u8~
        +CurrentRows: u32
        +RowsPerBlock: u32
        +append_batch(batch) Result
        +append_row(row) Result
        +flush() PaxBlock
        +flush_and_reset() Vec~PaxBlock~
    }

    class StorageEngineReader {
        <<interface>>
        +read_pax_block(offset) PaxBlock
        +scan_blocks(range) Stream
        +get_footer_cache() FooterCache
    }

    class FlushMaterializer {
        +memtable: Arc~MemtableManager~
        +writer: PaxBlockWriter
        +flush_to_storage() Result
        +build_pax_from_records() Result
    }

    PaxBlock "1" --> "1" PaxFooter : footer
    PaxBlock "1" --> "*" PaxColumnChunk : columns
    PaxFooter "1" --> "*" ZoneMap : zone_maps
    PaxSegmentScanner ..> PaxBlock : reads
    PaxSegmentScanner ..> ZoneMap : prunes with
    PaxBlockWriter ..> PaxBlock : creates
    FlushMaterializer --> PaxBlockWriter : uses
    FlushMaterializer ..> StorageEngineReader : writes to
    StorageEngineReader ..> PaxBlock : serves
